B.Pp=new A.bT("Does wave work offline?","Yes. You can use wave without internet. When you are online again, your changes sync to the server. Multi-device sync is supported.")
B.PA=new A.bT("What is wavesafe?","wavesafe is the protection package: encrypted storage on the device in special folders, plus end-to-end encryption (ws1.0) for data on the server. Your data is not sold or shared for advertising. There is no third-party marketing analytics in wave.")
B.Pe=new A.bT("Sync issues in Russia","On mobile data in Russia, sync may fail without a VPN. Use Wi\u2011Fi, or a VPN on mobile data, if synchronization does not work.")
