B.Pk=new A.bT("Agreement","By using the wave app, the WAVES company website, or related product pages, you agree to these Terms of Service.\n\nWAVES company is an independent brand (Created by maksy). Contact: waveofgoals@hotmail.com \xb7 Support: @WOFSupport_bot.")
