B.Pu=new A.bT("Offline use and connectivity","wave works offline. When you reconnect, data syncs with the server. In some regions (including Russia), mobile data without a VPN may prevent sync; Wi\u2011Fi or a VPN is recommended if sync fails on mobile networks.")
