B.Pf=new A.bT("Protection (wavesafe)","wavesafe is the protection package used with wave. It includes:\n\u2022 Encrypted local storage on your device in dedicated folders\n\u2022 End-to-end encryption over the network using wavesafe ws1.0 when data syncs with the server\n\nWe do not sell your personal data or share it with third parties for advertising.")
